@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@token = replace-with-local-access-token
@runId = 1
@compareRunId = 2

### Query a Payroll register report
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/payroll/v1/reports/advanced?kind=PayrollRegister&from=2026-10-01&to=2026-10-31&page=1&pageSize=50
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Query Payroll variance between two runs
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/payroll/v1/reports/advanced?kind=PayrollVariance&from=2026-10-01&to=2026-10-31&runId={{runId}}&compareRunId={{compareRunId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Query payment / outstanding / reconciliation evidence
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/payroll/v1/reports/advanced?kind=PaymentOutstanding&from=2026-10-01&to=2026-10-31&runId={{runId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Query Payroll cost by location and location type
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/payroll/v1/reports/advanced?kind=CostByLocation&from=2026-10-01&to=2026-10-31&runId={{runId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Export the Payroll register as CSV
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/payroll/v1/reports/advanced/export/csv?kind=PayrollRegister&from=2026-10-01&to=2026-10-31
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: text/csv

### Export the Payroll register as XLSX
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/payroll/v1/reports/advanced/export/xlsx?kind=PayrollRegister&from=2026-10-01&to=2026-10-31
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet
